        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DoralLock 6110,  Saint Thomas Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Saint Thomas Knob is available in your choice of 3 finishes (Polished Brass, Antique Brass, Brushed Chrome) that are highly resistant to tarnishing. All St. Thomas style door knobs have adjustable backset for 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\"  and fits a standard 2 1/8\" bore hole. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the DoralLock St. Thomas Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-drilled Doors</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 3 Security</li>\r\n<li>Sold as Complete Set</li>\r\n<li>Easy to Install</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry: Use when a keyed lock is needed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
